      "text": "The source declares a periodic refresh with a 60-second default, selects places with missing or expired forecasts, and attempts a refresh for each place. A per-place exception is logged as FORECAST_RETRY, allowing the loop to move on. The saved view covers cached returns, fixture/live-provider paths, response and transformation outcomes, and persistence/outbox effects. The linked forecasts-publish-pending view describes separate follow-on work; this captured process does not prove it ran afterward. The external-provider interaction is declared but not established by this evidence. Scheduler activation, provider responses, database commits, and event delivery remain unverified."
    },
    "title": "Refresh cached and provider forecasts"
  },
